3 - 4.4.beta (master)\nProbably earlier as well.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAs of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87479, the view will be adjusted to the IME, but it will only go to the start of the IME, not the end of it, where the caret actually is.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67bfada7-dabe-491a-bc2d-a2dbc81440fd)\n\nThere is code for scrolling to the IME in `adjust_viewport_to_caret`, but it doesn't seem to work. `_get_column_x_offset_for_line` just returns the same value.\n\nThough it does work properly vertically, even when text is wrapped.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Make sure word wrap is off (alt+z).\n2. Put the caret near the end of the right side of the view.\n3. Use IME to add text past the end.\n4. It does not scroll to keep the caret in view.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin"